<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Every user-visible string in feature/doctor.

  Fully externalised on purpose: this feature is read by two different people
  about the same data, and consent copy that only exists in English inside a
  composable cannot be reviewed, translated, or corrected without a code change.
  Prefix `doctor_` so a grep for the feature's copy returns all of it.

  Two strings are deliberately NOT here: PatientTrend.DISCLAIMER and
  DoctorInvite.unusableReason(). Those live in core:domain because the rules
  they describe live there, and re-stating them here would let the wording drift
  away from the behaviour it is describing.
-->
